},{"text":"the","start":21.62,"end":21.74},{"text":"leg.","start":21.74,"end":22.08}]},{"text":"In order to feel love within, we have to first express our desire to be connected to our spirit.","start":24.82,"end":35.06,"words":[{"text":"In","start":24.82,"end":24.96},{"text":"order","start":24.96,"end":25.26},{"text":"to","start":25.26,"end":25.54},{"text":"feel","start":25.54,"end":25.84},{"text":"love","start":25.84,"end":26.3},{"text":"within,","start":26.3,"end":27.38},{"text":"we","start":29.68,"end":29.74},{"text":"have","start":29.74,"end":29.86},{"text":"to","start":29.86,"end":30.06},{"text":"first","start":30.06,"end":30.38},{"text":"express","start":30.38,"end":30.92},{"text":"our","start":30.92,"end":31.44},{"text":"desire","start":31.44,"end":32.02},{"text":"to","start":32.02,"end":32.5},{"text":"be","start":33.16,"end":33.32},{"text":"connected","start":33.32,"end":33.72},{"text":"to","start":33.72,"end":34.34},{"text":"our","start":34.34,"end":34.56},{"text":"spirit.","start":34.56,"end":35.06}]},{"text":"We can pray to our mother Kundalini.","start":39.22,"end":41.66,"words":[{"text":"We","start":39.22,"end":39.42},{"text":"can","start":39.42,"end":39.72},{"text":"pray","start":39.72,"end":40.3},{"text":"to","start":40.3,"end":40.58},{"text":"our","start":40.58,"end":40.7},{"text":"mother","start":40.7,"end":40.94},{"text":"Kundalini.","start":40.94,"end":41.66}]},{"text":"Mother, please help me to know my spirit. Please help me to be connected with the truest part of myself.","start":44.94,"end":58.16,"words":[{"text":"Mother,","start":44.94,"end":45.38},{"text":"please","start":45.38,"end":45.9},{"text":"help","start":45.9,"end":46.3},{"text":"me","start":46.3,"end":46.74},{"text":"to","start":46.74,"end":47.1},{"text":"know","start":47.1,"end":47.48},{"text":"my","start":47.48,"end":47.86},{"text":"spirit.","start":47.86,"end":48.72},{"text":"Please","start":53,"end":53.2},{"text":"help","start":53.2,"end":53.54},{"text":"me","start":53.54,"end":54.06},{"text":"to","start":54.4,"end":54.72},{"text":"be","start":54.72,"end":54.86},{"text":"connected","start":54.86,"end":55.32},{"text":"with","start":55.32,"end":55.94},{"text":"the","start":55.94,"end":56.18},{"text":"truest","start":56.18,"end":56.56},{"text":"part","start":56.56,"end":56.92},{"text":"of","start":56.92,"end":57.16},{"text":"myself.","start":57.16,"end":58.16}]},{"text":"Next, we can bring our right hand onto our heart where our spirit resides, keeping the left hand open in the lap.","start":77.38,"end":88.08,"words":[{"text":"Next,","start":77.38,"end":78.28},{"text":"we","start":78.66,"end":78.74},{"text":"can","start":78.74,"end":78.9},{"text":"bring","start":78.9,"end":79.08},{"text":"our","start":79.08,"end":79.32},{"text":"right","start":79.32,"end":79.54},{"text":"hand","start":79.54,"end":80},{"text":"onto","start":80.5,"end":81},{"text":"our","start":81,"end":81.28},{"text":"heart","start":81.28,"end":81.76},{"text":"where","start":81.76,"end":82.26},{"text":"our","start":82.9,"end":83.12},{"text":"spirit","start":83.12,"end":83.4},{"text":"resides,","start":83.4,"end":84.48},{"text":"keeping","start":85.62,"end":85.82},{"text":"the","start":85.82,"end":86.06},{"text":"left","start":86.06,"end":86.34},{"text":"hand","start":86.34,"end":86.6},{"text":"open","start":86.6,"end":87},{"text":"in","start":87,"end":87.32},{"text":"the","start":87.32,"end":87.42},{"text":"lap.","start":87.42,"end":88.08}]},{"text":"Here, with all confidence, we can affirm silently within, I am the pure spirit. Meaning that I am not this body, I am not this mind.","start":95.5,"end":112.42,"words":[{"text":"Here,","start":95.5,"end":96.32},{"text":"with","start":96.32,"end":96.54},{"text":"all","start":96.54,"end":96.88},{"text":"confidence,","start":96.88,"end":98.06},{"text":"we","start":99.1,"end":99.14},{"text":"can","start":99.14,"end":99.34},{"text":"affirm","start":99.34,"end":99.82},{"text":"silently","start":99.82,"end":100.78},{"text":"within,","sta